Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill lists
 set_tool_cutter_params; a drawn neck feeds the checks

Adds the set_tool_cutter_params row (its params and neck shape from
crates/app/src/mcp/cutter_tools.rs). set_tool_cutter_profile's "display
only" note is corrected: the collision checks and the simulation read a
drawn neck where it is narrower than the stated shank (never wider).
PROCESS_VERSION 31.

Fixes #1013

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
